<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Brand storytelling</h2>
<p>Before launching brand storytelling automation, prove every app in the stack logs email and SMS consent auditably, with purchase events cutting promotional follow-up the moment checkout completes. Brand Storytelling audiences forgive plain creative; they do not forgive promos sent mid-refund or right after checkout.</p>
