<thead><tr><th>Audience state</th><th>Required handling</th><th>Why it matters</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>No documented consent</td><td>Suppress brand storytelling marketing entirely until consent is documented</td><td>Every brand storytelling send stands on documented consent</td></tr>
<tr><td>Consented, never purchased</td><td>First brand storytelling touches teach and reassure before selling</td><td>Brand Storytelling margin suffers when discounts arrive first</td></tr>
<tr><td>Active cart, no checkout</td><td>Context-rich brand storytelling nudge before any incentive</td><td>Guards brand storytelling margin while intent peaks</td></tr>
<tr><td>Purchased recently</td><td>Pause brand storytelling promos; switch to post-purchase teaching</td><td>Keeps brand storytelling buyers from instant list fatigue</td></tr>
<tr><td>Refund or return open</td><td>Brand Storytelling selling waits for case resolution</td><td>Brand Storytelling tolerance collapses mid-dispute</td></tr>
<tr><td>Repeated non-engagement</td><td>Remove chronic brand storytelling non-openers pre-complaint</td><td>Brand Storytelling deliverability depends on pruning</td></tr>
<tr><td>SMS consent present</td><td>Brand Storytelling texting respects time and frequency rules</td><td>Text grievances hit brand storytelling programs hardest</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wholesale or B2B account</td><td>Isolate brand storytelling wholesale comms from retail blasts</td><td>Wholesale brand storytelling terms forbid retail-style offers</td></tr>
<tr><td>Free or disposable email domain</td><td>Verify brand storytelling throwaway addresses pre-journey</td><td>Brand Storytelling bounces from junk signups hurt inboxing</td></tr>
<tr><td>Staff and test accounts</td><td>Keep brand storytelling staff and test profiles out of live sends</td><td>QA brand storytelling sends distort real performance</td></tr>
<tr><td>Competitor or researcher signals</td><td>No bespoke brand storytelling track for competitor signals</td><td>Brand Storytelling one-offs breed audit gaps</td></tr>
<tr><td>Legacy list without timestamps</td><td>Re-permission legacy brand storytelling lists pre-automation</td><td>Brand Storytelling compliance demands re-permission</td></tr>
