<h2 class="mt-12">Peak season readiness for brand storytelling</h2>
<ol>
<li>Halt brand storytelling edits ahead of the peak window.</li>
<li>Brand Storytelling QA spans purchase, refund, and case paths.</li>
<li>Check brand storytelling exits filter buyers and open cases.</li>
<li>Enlarge brand storytelling holdouts so peak reads stay valid.</li>
<li>For brand storytelling, pre-commit text timing and frequency limits.</li>
<li>For brand storytelling, test tier limits against peak projections.</li>
<li>Staff daily brand storytelling deliverability watch on complaints and bounces.</li>
