<p>One more brand storytelling operating note: book the first quarterly review before launch, not after the first crisis. Brand Storytelling teams that record suppression rules, discount caps, and escalation contacts in week one firefight far less later, and new operators inherit a brand storytelling system instead of folklore.</p>
<p>Finally, review brand storytelling in writing each quarter: what brand storytelling work shipped, what was suppressed, what margin the brand storytelling program kept, which assumptions failed. That brand storytelling record turns individual judgment into team knowledge and keeps vendor calls evidence-based.</p>
